{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.060954063354399235,"w":0.063786004384358663,"c":1,"t":"Test 7","x":0.85802469272551607},{"t":"DAVE:","y":0.10901162778562135,"h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.084362139135531658,"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1},{"t":"NATALIE:","w":0.059799925486246741,"y":0.13930879906797178,"c":1,"h":0.0091730995088359357,"x":0.082239954852912495},{"c":1,"x":0.082304526181903093,"w":0.041152264277140291,"t":"DAVE:","y":0.15552325569072778,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"t":"NATALIE:","y":0.21607221387102005,"c":1,"w":0.059995059967041006,"h":0.01116952570363694,"x":0.082142387605800879},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"DAVE:","c":1,"w":0.043209877014160167,"x":0.080246913224744337,"y":0.29360465102599875},{"x":0.15432098660825772,"w":0.67283950805664072,"y":0.10747938768203269,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Right, especially as the only possible place for it would be at the entrance, and that's","c":1},{"h":0.014538307774052961,"c":1,"x":0.15432098998917326,"w":0.20576131184895835,"y":0.12209302311244874,"t":"right in front of the castle."},{"t":"Mmm.","y":0.13849906293669056,"x":0.15202220754247028,"w":0.058323421478271464,"h":0.012255004774976541,"c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054074,"t":"But it could be a good thing for the town of Horton. At present it's a bit of a ghost","x":0.15432098315890508,"c":1,"y":0.1525323909665921,"w":0.63991770426432293},{"y":0.16699055428028287,"x":0.15217660386243581,"w":0.66686182657877602,"t":"town. Once they've left school and got any skills or qualifications, the young people.","c":1,"h":0.017638988292680624},{"x":0.15226336276195751,"c":1,"t":"all get out as fast as they can to get jobs in the city, and the only people left are","y":0.1845930231226397,"w":0.63168726603190106,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.27182253519694011,"h":0.013692471669335182,"x":0.15423946944978109,"c":1,"t":"children and those who've retired.","y":0.19857450584285208},{"c":1,"y":0.21511627893676943,"t":"Right. Something else we could investigate would be the potential damage that","x":0.15432099320250625,"w":0.62962961832682296,"h":0.014565699794126696},{"w":0.66872426350911462,"t":"tourists might cause to the castle site, I mean their environmental impact. At present","y":0.22965116304878286,"x":0.15226338764873484,"h":0.015988371257085521,"c":1},{"h":0.017340152929191555,"x":0.15218082818589124,"w":0.64009017944335933,"c":1,"y":0.24432962345374831,"t":"the tourists can just wander round wherever they want, but if numbers increase,"},{"x":0.15221009493926232,"t":"there might have to be some restrictions, like sticking to marked ways. And there'd","w":0.65853510538736981,"y":0.26012273773482164,"h":0.017324158945970947,"c":1},{"x":0.15226337648819405,"c":1,"t":"need to be guides and wardens around to make sure these were enforced.","y":0.27616279056171544,"w":0.59670781453450528,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"t":"Yes, we could look at that too. OK, well ...","c":1,"h":0.017541208592966373,"w":0.33771385192871095,"x":0.15212370064902975,"y":0.2906479667178814},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.83333333394292997,"y":0.17005813937885528,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q29"},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.83333333394292997,"y":0.24709302309978554,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q30"},{"x":0.080246910808648028,"y":0.34156976730142441,"w":0.15637860616048177,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"SECTION 4"},{"t":"OK, so we've been looking at how man-made changes in our environment can affect wildlife.","c":1,"h":0.016748433399537466,"x":0.080187715995443221,"y":0.36912827609130727,"w":0.72234415690104159},{"x":0.07810359328111123,"w":0.73473307291666667,"h":0.017637381986116973,"c":1,"t":"Now I'll discuss a particular example. Let's take a look at mercury. Mercury's one of the 120 or","y":0.3840843627465379},{"t":"so elements that make up all matter, and it has the symbol Hg. It's a shiny, silvery substance.","x":0.078088331576607009,"w":0.72654312133789067,"y":0.39882167683092906,"h":0.018773246288861234,"c":1},{"w":0.69360407511393229,"c":1,"h":0.017984731739345339,"t":"You may have seen it in old-fashioned thermometers, but it's not used much for domestic","x":0.078088558903284783,"y":0.41481127603829893},{"c":1,"h":0.01453659587810685,"t":"purposes now because it's highly toxic.","y":0.43168433447388588,"w":0.3086419677734375,"x":0.07818930411897923},{"y":0.45494186033173778,"c":1,"w":0.70370371500651041,"t":"But the problem is that the amount of mercury in the environment's increasing. The main","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.078189294626335296},{"w":0.74497858683268237,"h":0.016959079162813362,"t":"reason for this is the power plants used to produce electricity. The main source of energy that","y":0.46921646180937082,"c":1,"x":0.076069199837343532},{"w":0.73266632080078131,"y":0.48439001606028576,"h":0.01724263607964216,"x":0.076061278885878783,"t":"most of them use is still coal, and when it's burned it releases mercury into the atmosphere.","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.49973718305997938,"w":0.67302739461263017,"t":"Some of this gets deposited into lakes and rivers, and if it's ingested by a fish it's not","x":0.078082878616601625,"h":0.01837716141915291},{"t":"excreted, it stays in the fish's body and it enters the food chain. So it's been known for some","y":0.51590106019504112,"w":0.73456792195638021,"x":0.07613167664317691,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"t":"time that birds which eat fish may be affected, but what wasn't known until quite recently is","c":1,"y":0.53197674405071205,"h":0.014548579711374909,"w":0.72222223917643236,"x":0.076131678532541686},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.076131684155536727,"y":0.54796511615792221,"c":1,"w":0.38065844217936201,"t":"that those that eat insects can also be affected."},{"t":"So a woman called Claire Varian-Ramos is doing some research on how this is affecting","c":1,"x":0.076078321479742597,"w":0.7017626444498698,"y":0.56974063540273445,"h":0.01671284753105251},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"birds.","x":0.07613168750398823,"y":0.58575581377442354,"w":0.049382715225219712},{"x":0.076131680545705932,"t":"And rather than looking at how many birds are actually killed by mercury poisoning, she's","y":0.60895170803296284,"w":0.70987655639648439,"h":0.016048292108362783,"c":1},{"t":"looking for more subtle sub-effects. And these may be to do with the behaviour of the birds.","x":0.076131685870986038,"w":0.73045267740885411,"h":0.014575971731448756,"c":1,"y":0.62499999986707755},{"x":0.076049192383089145,"t":"or with the effect of mercury on the way their brain works, so whether it leads to problems","y":0.63897423565426048,"c":1,"h":0.017500736407312534,"w":0.71210683186848955},{"y":0.65376851351165988,"t":"with memory, for example. And she's particularly focusing on the effects of mercury on","h":0.017877012034889117,"c":1,"x":0.074021477790410392,"w":0.68943517049153646},{"y":0.67137809202736687,"x":0.076131683372315379,"t":"bird song. Now, the process of song learning happens at a particular stage in the birds'","w":0.69135803222656245,"c":1,"h":0.01472320376914027},{"w":0.73465993245442707,"y":0.68602112326335507,"t":"development, and what you may not know is that a young bird seems to acquire this skill by","x":0.074029890035920212,"c":1,"h":0.01660275318878135},{"w":0.59259256998697918,"h":0.014567411690072807,"c":1,"y":0.70200235587974091,"t":"listening to the songs produced by its father, rather than by any other bird.","x":0.074074085268347384},{"c":1,"h":0.014560564106288587,"x":0.074074078967131529,"y":0.72526501741711646,"t":"And Varian-Ramos has already found in her research that if young male birds are exposed to.","w":0.74485595703125007},{"x":0.074019020307930533,"w":0.72439814249674483,"t":"mercury, if they eat food contaminated with mercury, then the songs they produce aren't as","h":0.016858100891113281,"y":0.73937108705269849,"c":1},{"x":0.074005701619106884,"y":0.75445491203438531,"w":0.72033355712890623,"c":1,"t":"complex as those produced by other birds. So quite low-level exposure to mercury is likely","h":0.01740236697966413},{"h":0.016000356213644817,"c":1,"t":"to have an impact on male birds in a natural situation, because it can mean that they're less","x":0.074074072711102112,"y":0.77179034160210624,"w":0.73045267740885422},{"x":0.074074075196949377,"y":0.78621908103047788,"c":1,"t":"attractive to female birds, and so it can affect their chances of reproduction.","w":0.60288065592447904,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"w":0.72444763183593741,"y":0.80766184019893139,"t":"Now the way she's carrying out this research is worth thinking about. She's using a mixture","c":1,"x":0.073989129156652303,"h":0.01871351078064909},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.72427983601888024,"t":"of studies using birds kept in laboratories, and studies carried out outdoors in the wild. The","x":0.074074073651211922,"y":0.82558139521598584,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.70814559936523436,"t":"lab-based studies have the advantage that you don't get all the variables you would in a.","x":0.071870037697880876,"h":0.020244564689932854,"y":0.83737834330354832},{"t":"natural setting, so the experimenter has a much higher level of control, and that means they","x":0.071945793814538778,"c":1,"y":0.85407247539299314,"w":0.73269129435221347,"h":0.018070475372745753},{"y":0.87209302312280013,"c":1,"t":"can be more confident about their results in some ways. And of course they don't have to","w":0.70987655639648439,"h":0.01453830777405285,"x":0.072016454206448852},{"t":"worry about going out and finding the birds in order to observe them.","x":0.072016477335411083,"y":0.88662790722608864,"w":0.54938268025716153,"h":0.014534882858869502,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.83127572055873167,"w":0.034979422887166267,"t":"Q31","y":0.53343023239970644,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"x":0.82921810760548131,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q32","y":0.62645348821606461,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"t":"Q33","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.82921810760548131,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.67296511612304133},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.72674418588807843,"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.8292181075994296,"c":1,"t":"Q34"},{"x":0.82921810734222789,"c":1,"t":"Q35","y":0.78779069795499312,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"w":0.039094651540120373,"c":1,"x":0.82716049305710027,"y":0.82703488356490173,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q36"},{"x":0.87242798276260447,"t":"109","y":0.93459302307977721,"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.2082209142049154,"c":1,"h":0.016453971009091628,"x":0.39483721545198913,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258519867956}]}